{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/7bf49a91bc0ddac2aac17330674429b1.poster.avif?t=1770322523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/7bf49a91bc0ddac2aac17330674429b1.webm?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/7bf49a91bc0ddac2aac17330674429b1.mp4?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights. Dinosaurs. Guns.</strong> Build a squad where medieval warfare meets prehistoric power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Auto-Battles.</strong> Position units, plan synergies, and watch fights unfold automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer.</strong> Battle real player teams anytime, at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Shop.</strong> Roll, merge, and upgrade to unlock higher-tier units and combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability.</strong> Try new lineups, synergies, and evolving metas every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/cbe9ff64c3da1aab60c6af7aa323f484.poster.avif?t=1770322523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/cbe9ff64c3da1aab60c6af7aa323f484.webm?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/cbe9ff64c3da1aab60c6af7aa323f484.mp4?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft Units:</strong> Spend gold each round to recruit knights and dinosaurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge:</strong> Combine three of a kind to evolve stronger versions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning:</strong> Arrange your squad before each battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Battle:</strong> Units fight automatically using their stats and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop Tiers:</strong> Higher rounds unlock stronger units and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergies:</strong> Combine classes and species for team-wide bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong> Attach weapons and gear for extra power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Battles:</strong> Fight real player teams anytime at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-Based:</strong> Build a new team every run and experiment with strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/948d7384ebf5aa8176312f287e7f0701.poster.avif?t=1770322523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/948d7384ebf5aa8176312f287e7f0701.webm?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/948d7384ebf5aa8176312f287e7f0701.mp4?t=1770322523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra